OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Aimmigration offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded not guilty to two
OL,7,Fcounts of assisting unlawful
OL,8,Fimmigration.
OL,10,FJames Andrew Harris, of Eaton Bray,
OL,11,FBedfordshire, was accused of trying to
OL,12,Fbring two Albanian nationals to Jersey
OL,13,Fon 25 July.
OL,15,FThe 45-year-old appeared via video link
OL,16,Fin Jersey's Royal Court to enter his
OL,17,Fpleas and advocate James Bell made no
OL,18,Fapplication for bail.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
