OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Aimmigration offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarris was remanded in custody and was
OL,7,Fnext due to appear in court on 5
OL,8,FNovember. The court heard a three-day
OL,9,Ftrial was due to take place from 8
OL,10,FFebruary.
